ll times. Some areas of the Center are restricted to staff access only.\n* Food is only permitted in our Park or Pollinator event spaces.\n* Not all animals can be pet. Your guide will invite you to pet when available.\n* Animals are very sensitive to and easily startled by loud, high-pitched sounds and fast movement. Help children act respectfully around the animals by keeping \"voices low and feet slow.\" For this reason flash photography is also prohibited.", "cancellation_notes": "", "no_transportation_notes": "", "no_transportation_minutes": 15, "headline": "Schools • Scouts • Playgroups • Hands-On Interactions", "short_description": "Hop into fun with an unforgettable animal experience", "image_url": "", "image_cdn_url": "", "images": [{"cls": "Image", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/animalcenter/items/575652/images/1946002/", "pk": 1946002, "unicode": "photo", "gallery": "carousel", "image_url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/6F2dmX1dRk4aJxzY4wPr", "image_cdn_url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/6F2dmX1dRk4aJxzY4wPr", "company": {"cls": "Company", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/animalcenter/"}, "item": {"cls": "Item", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/animalcenter/items/575652/"}, "crop": {"x": 0, "y": 162, "width": 2560, "height": 1347, "url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/sEO38S0T9esk4TOgzFek"}, "cropped_url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/sEO38S0T9esk4TOgzFek", "cropped_cdn_url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/sEO38S0T9esk4TOgzFek", "is_low_resolution": false, "has_text_overlay": false, "has_logo_overlay": false}, {"cls": "Image", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/animalcenter/items/575652/images/1820508/", "pk": 1820508, "unicode": "photo", "gallery": "carousel", "image_url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/8OvjDRxnQH2nJlmObrq1", "image_cdn_url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/8OvjDRxnQH2nJlmObrq1", "company": {"cls": "Company", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/animalcenter/"}, "item": {"cls": "Item", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/animalcenter/items/575652/"}, "crop": {"